%% VehicleSequenceViews::startVehicleView — sequence rendering (view def SequenceView)
sequenceDiagram
  participant n0 as action startVehicle
  participant n1 as part driver (Driver)
  participant n2 as part vehicle (Vehicle)
  n0->>n0: of IgnitionCmd
  n0->>n0: of EngineStatus
  n1->>n2: of ignitionCmd : IgnitionCmd
  n2->>n1: of es : EngineStatus
